{"ID":"20240123094945-v0b6qa7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240123094945-v0b6qa7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240123094945-v0b6qa7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240123094945-l1fd0qy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240126083856-l2nqk8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240123094945-l1fd0qy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20240906134451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240123094945-l1fd0qy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123094945-l1fd0qy","updated":"20240204101525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"剂取药缓力专；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"者荡也，汤剂扫荡力道强；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（粉）剂不易流动，散剂在用于喉咙类疾病，倾向上焦，外伤比较好用；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"膏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"剂可染发内服；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"剂蜡封，久储耐放；..."}]},{"ID":"20240123095607-6czh5ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123095607-6czh5ma","updated":"20240126172807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、汉朝度量衡，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"斤两斗升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，汉朝一两就是我们现在的一钱；一钱又大概等于3.3g；一钱等于十分；（台湾用钱，大陆用克）；"}]},{"ID":"20240123095102-8ovoqp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123095102-8ovoqp7","updated":"20240123101607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、生附子去里寒破阴实用，炮附子表阳虚用；"}]},{"ID":"20240123101811-xzufxy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123101811-xzufxy5","updated":"20240123102226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、君二臣一奇之制也（2+1=3），君二臣四偶之制也（2+4=6）——黄帝内经；（奇数偶数）"}]},{"ID":"20240123102337-ay7q18y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123102337-ay7q18y","updated":"20240123102702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.1、奇之不去则偶（重方，加重药味；如四逆汤对治无效，用通脉四逆汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240123102005-ims6b6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123102005-ims6b6m","updated":"20240123102133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、中医最大的优点是个人的处方（因人施药），西医是大家的处方（统一标准用药）；"}]},{"ID":"20240123102148-dc7d1oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123102148-dc7d1oz","updated":"20240130141017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、神农本草经药分三种：养生、扼制病情发展、除邪；"}]},{"ID":"20240123104030-e1vwwkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123104030-e1vwwkc","updated":"20240123110935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、判断蔬果是否有毒，丢入水中，浮起来的没毒，沉下去的有毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240123110935-fodw4p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123110935-fodw4p3","updated":"20240123111149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、肝有筋缩，急食甘以缓之；"}]},{"ID":"20240123111140-ddvkihe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123111140-ddvkihe","updated":"20240123112516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、食物讲究五味平衡，失衡则身体异常，如甜的吃多了容易脱发秃头；"}]},{"ID":"20240123112037-ufea8kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123112037-ufea8kx","updated":"20240123170104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酸能收敛收涩；如酸梅止下痢止汗；如睡觉眼睛闭不起来；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123113751-g6p617v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123113751-g6p617v","updated":"20240123114055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦能泻能燥能坚；（泻：吃到坏食物，苦味药宣泻之）；（燥：祛湿）；（坚：让软的东西变硬，所以有的壮阳药苦）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123112010-19i9lg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123112010-19i9lg1","updated":"20240123114349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘能补能和能缓；（补：大部分补药都有甘味药在里面）；（和：让药性不一或药性冲突的药和谐共处，和事老）；（缓：如抽筋、癫痫拘急）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123114349-im3qc3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123114349-im3qc3r","updated":"20240123135819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛能散能润；（散：让药能够在身体里面横行无阻，往外发散）；（润：能够滋润）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123115759-nebvgj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123115759-nebvgj6","updated":"20240123135821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"咸能软坚能攻下；（软坚：让东西变软，如肿瘤硬块）；（攻下：下剂，如肾结石，软坚而能从下焦排出；）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123135559-eengqvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123135559-eengqvk","updated":"20240123135852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"除酸苦甘辛咸，还有淡味，平常吃的饮食跟蔬菜全部属于淡味，淡味药能利窍能渗泻能利湿；（淡味药如颜色白色，则入肺，色黄入脾...）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123135810-1v2551i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123135810-1v2551i","updated":"20240123140055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、人工精炼盐吃进身体里会积水，天然海盐青盐吃进身体里则是利尿的；"}]},{"ID":"20240123140057-od7nwuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123140057-od7nwuq","updated":"20240125094208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师戒烟处方：皂荚三钱、红枣十枚、苦参三钱、黄芩二钱、黄柏三钱、黄连二钱、半夏二钱、南星二钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123140629-bntaepl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123140629-bntaepl","updated":"20240123140638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.1、皂荚（去油渍），红枣（护胃），天南星（去痰），这三味药主要清洁肺部。"}]},{"ID":"20240123140645-pt5uvfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123140645-pt5uvfw","updated":"20240123140647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.2、半夏（利水），石膏（去胃热），知母（去胃湿），这三味药主要清洁胃，也有减肥功效"}]},{"ID":"20240123140649-b2jmmxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123140649-b2jmmxd","updated":"20240123140656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.3、柴胡（疏肝），黄芩（清热），郁金（解郁），这三味主要用来疏肝解郁。"}]},{"ID":"20240123143005-snv0rv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143005-snv0rv1","updated":"20240125142514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★13、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五味之用──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143208-mataepl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143208-mataepl","updated":"20240125142453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡药酸者能涩能收，苦者能泻能燥能坚，甘者能补能和能缓，辛者能散能润能横行，咸者能下能软坚，淡者能利窍能渗泄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123140615-jzshav1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123140615-jzshav1","updated":"20240123143031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴阳之义──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143210-8q78hpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143210-8q78hpc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒热温凉是气也，酸苦甘辛咸是味也，气为阳味为阴，其气厚者为阳中之阳，薄者阳中之阴也。味厚者阴中之阴，薄者阴中之阳，气薄主发泄散表，厚则发热与温，味厚则泄降，薄则通窍，利渗湿，辛甘发散为阳，酸苦涌泄为阴，咸味涌泄为阴，淡味渗泄为阳，轻清升浮为阳，重浊沉降为阴，阳气出上窍，阴味出下窍，清阳发肌理。浊阴走五脏。清阳实四肢，浊阴归六腑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123170545-n8iv117","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123170545-n8iv117","updated":"20240123170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14.1、描述药味药性时，用寒热温凉这些字眼代表着药味的气，为阳；酸苦甘辛咸这些字眼代表着药味的味，为阴；"}]},{"ID":"20240123141930-cvzhq84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123141930-cvzhq84","updated":"20240123143036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药之相从──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143202-7ygy4l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143202-7ygy4l3","updated":"20240123143439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡药清虚者浮而升，重实者沉而降，味薄者升而生如春季，气薄者降而收象秋季。气厚者浮而长象夏天，味厚者沉而藏象冬天，味平者化而成象长夏，气厚味薄者浮而升，味厚气薄者沉而降，气味俱厚者能浮能沉，气味俱薄者可升可降，酸咸无升，辛甘无降，寒无浮，热无沉，此升降浮沉之义也，凡药根在土中者，半身以上则上升，半身以下则下降，药为枝者达四肢，为皮者达皮肤。为心为干者内行脏腑，质轻者上入心肺，重者下入肝肾，中空者发表，内实者攻里，枯燥者入气分，润泽者入血分，此上下内外之相从也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123135853-lhlv9c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123135853-lhlv9c6","updated":"20240123143050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药色之入经脉── "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143205-f7xhzx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143205-f7xhzx3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡药色青，味酸，气臊，性属木，皆入足厥阴肝，足少阳胆经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143120-go46i1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143120-go46i1p","updated":"20240123143120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"色赤味苦，气焦，性属火者，皆入手少阴心，手太阳小肠经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143120-p6hm5nu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143120-p6hm5nu","updated":"20240123143120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"色黄味甘，气香性属土者，皆入足太阴脾，足阳明胃经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143120-s3k5dae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143120-s3k5dae","updated":"20240123143120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"色白味辛，气腥，性属金者，皆入手太阴肺，手阳明大肠经。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143120-z6dk6wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143120-z6dk6wt","updated":"20240123143120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"色黑味咸，气腐，性属水者，皆入足少阴肾，足太阳膀胱经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143120-xa9in5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143120-xa9in5m","updated":"20240123144740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"十二经中唯手厥阴心包，手少阳三焦经无所主，其经通于足厥阴少阳，而厥阴主血，诸药入肝经血分者，并入心包，少阳主气。诸药入胆经气分者并入三焦，命门相火，散行于胆三焦心包，故入命门者并入三焦，此诸药入诸经之分布也。药有相需者，同类而不可离者。相使者，我之佐使也。相恶者，夺我之能也。相畏者，受彼之制也，相反者。两不相合也。相杀者，制彼之毒也，此异同之义也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143126-ecgyek0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143126-ecgyek0","updated":"20240123143128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏补泻之义──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143140-ll92wr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143140-ll92wr9","updated":"20240123143140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝苦急，急食甘而缓之；肝欲散，急食辛以散之，以辛补之，以酸泻之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143140-4f19od5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143140-4f19od5","updated":"20240123143140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心苦缓，急食酸以收之；心欲软，急食咸以软之，以咸补之，以甘泻之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143140-0q0a9ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143140-0q0a9ky","updated":"20240123143140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾苦湿，急食苦以燥之；脾欲缓，急食甘以缓之，以甘补之，以苦泻之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143140-npravbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143140-npravbd","updated":"20240123152933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺苦气上逆，急食苦以泻之；肺欲收，急食酸以收之，以酸补之，以辛泻之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143140-xbs7q3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143140-xbs7q3h","updated":"20240123143140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾苦燥，急食辛以润之；肾欲坚，急食苦以坚之，以苦补之，以咸泻之，此是其义也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123152050-a3hx59b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152050-a3hx59b","updated":"20240123152817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17.1、"}]},{"ID":"20240123152134-pdsvwyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152134-pdsvwyz","updated":"20240123152805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金克木，辛味药能补肝；酸味药能泻肝；"}]},{"ID":"20240123152055-hsfvj24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152055-hsfvj24","updated":"20240123152812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水克火，咸味药能补心；甘味药能泻心；"}]},{"ID":"20240123152611-fuojywq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152611-fuojywq","updated":"20240123152904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾为土，甘味药能补脾；苦味药能泻脾；"}]},{"ID":"20240123152633-0scl3g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152633-0scl3g7","updated":"20240123153251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺苦气上逆，苦味药能泻之；酸味药能补肺，辛味药能泻肺；"}]},{"ID":"20240123152652-nrjdc4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123152652-nrjdc4n","updated":"20240123153340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾苦燥喜湿，辛味药能润之；苦味药能坚肾补肾，咸味药能泻肾；"}]},{"ID":"20240123153744-lij6m42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123153744-lij6m42","updated":"20240125161258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、补精常用子类（种子类）的药，如菟丝子、覆盆子..."}]},{"ID":"20240123143152-2we2pid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143152-2we2pid","updated":"20240123153904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六淫主治──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-169o0p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-169o0p3","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"风淫于内，治以辛凉，佐以苦甘，以甘缓之，以辛散之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-ftpfev4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-ftpfev4","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"热淫于内，治以咸寒，佐以甘苦，以酸收之，以苦发之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-69qo04m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-69qo04m","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿淫于内，治以苦热，佐以酸淡，以苦燥之，以淡泄之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-roxm6zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-roxm6zi","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"火淫于内，治以咸冷，佐以苦辛，以酸收之，以苦发之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-gp39bbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-gp39bbn","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"燥淫于内，治以苦温，佐以甘辛，以苦下之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-2bms9c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-2bms9c9","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒淫于内，治以甘热，佐以苦辛，以咸泻之，以辛润之，以苦坚之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143155-lxgg0n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143155-lxgg0n8","updated":"20240123143155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"此六淫主治，各有所宜，故药性须明，而施用贵审也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123154014-chfg97l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123154014-chfg97l","updated":"20240123154046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.1、一种病痛会移动，一会痛这，一会痛那，属于风症；"}]},{"ID":"20240123165322-lof7o68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123165322-lof7o68","updated":"20240123165512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、葛根汤就是温病的方子——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20240123165514-rolu4es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123165514-rolu4es","updated":"20240123165649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、如寒药去热无效，可以试试用咸味的药去热，一般咸味的药是阳药，热力很强的药，热极生寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240123171242-6h5k1zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123171242-6h5k1zw","updated":"20240123171346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、便血：先血后便为内痔，先便后血为外痔，血便混合为大肠炎；"}]},{"ID":"20240123143213-cospvpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143213-cospvpg","updated":"20240123165556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五行相生──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143226-k1g9hyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143226-k1g9hyy","updated":"20240123172230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"人之五藏应五行，子母相生，经曰：虚则补其母，实则泻其子。又曰：子能令母实，母能令子虚，如肾为肝母，心为肝子，故入肝者并入肾与心。肝为心母，脾为心子，故入心者并入肝与脾。心为脾母，肺为脾子，故入脾者并入心与肺。脾为肺母，肾为肺子，故入肺者并入脾与肾。肺为肾母，肝为肾子，故入肾者并入肺与肝。此五行相生子母相应之义也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123172856-lov6naa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123172856-lov6naa","updated":"20240123173001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22.1、子能令母实，如需让脾实，则食白色的药，白色实脾，如山药、米面类食物；"}]},{"ID":"20240123143216-41j3j3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143216-41j3j3o","updated":"20240123165559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五行相克──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143252-9aa7rmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143252-9aa7rmx","updated":"20240123173822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酸伤筋，辛胜酸；苦伤气，咸胜苦；甘伤肉，酸胜甘；辛伤皮毛，苦胜辛；咸伤血，甘胜咸。因为酸主收敛，敛则筋缩，苦能泻气，辛能疏散肌理，咸能渗泄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123173905-ms6999m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123173905-ms6999m","updated":"20240123174212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23.1、常食酸对肝（筋）好，不能太过，过则伤筋，筋受伤也不宜吃酸，如食酸伤之，则可食辛味对治，金克木；"}]},{"ID":"20240123143236-9u823y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143236-9u823y9","updated":"20240123165601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五病所禁──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143249-mk8t0kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143249-mk8t0kg","updated":"20240123143249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酸走筋，故筋病勿多食酸，筋得酸则拘急，收引益盛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143249-sqcu20w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143249-sqcu20w","updated":"20240123143249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦走骨，故骨病勿多食苦，骨得苦则阴益盛，令人重而难举。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143249-317dijv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143249-317dijv","updated":"20240123143249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘走肉，肉痛勿多食甘，肉病得甘则壅气，臃肿益甚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143249-3amumdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143249-3amumdh","updated":"20240123143249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛走气，气病勿多食辛，气得辛则散，而益虚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143249-ine8gqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143249-ine8gqx","updated":"20240123143249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"咸走血，血病勿多食咸，血得咸则凝涩，而口渴也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123174904-xfnlct8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123174904-xfnlct8","updated":"20240123175040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24.1、吃阿司匹林可以预防心脏病，但会脑中风；（阿斯匹布是酸味药，酸主收敛，吃多了会导致血管收敛）"}]},{"ID":"20240123175153-hesspw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123175153-hesspw8","updated":"20240124081757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24.2、怎么判断人的血液是稠还是稀？问是否口渴，口渴则为血稠（食甘可解之，自然的甜食）；"}]},{"ID":"20240124081641-dqtudp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124081641-dqtudp9","updated":"20240124081710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24.3、肾脏功能差病人会口渴，如肾脏功能恢复，症状会消失；"}]},{"ID":"20240123143239-orzwefj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143239-orzwefj","updated":"20240123165603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五味所伤──"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123143303-lgez6wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123143303-lgez6wj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多食咸，则脉凝泣而变色。多食苦，则皮槁而毛拔。多食辛，则筋急而爪枯。多食酸，则肉消皮厚而唇开。多食甘，则骨痛而发落。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240123170107-y9wgz1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240123170107-y9wgz1e","updated":"20240124082653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药之为物，各有其形性气质，其入诸经，有因形相类者，有因性相从者，有因气相求者，有因质相同者，自然之理，可以以意得也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240124082711-7wuupht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124082711-7wuupht","updated":"20240124083856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"形"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，人参狗脊之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"色"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，黄连黑参之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，豨莶香薷之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"味"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，甘草苦参之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"质"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，石膏石脂归身归尾之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"时"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，夏枯款冬之类是也，有以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"名者，何首乌骨碎补之类是也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240124082821-61wg8yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124082821-61wg8yd","updated":"20240124083225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.1、如番茄，番茄红色入心，番茄切开，里面一个个房间像心脏的心室，而番茄味淡，淡味是利水渗泻的，能把水利出来，所以心脏积水吃番茄很好；绿番茄入肝，木生火，味淡..."}]},{"ID":"20240124090503-gj8rp9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124090503-gj8rp9h","updated":"20240124090508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡药火制四，煨炙炒煆【xiā】也。水制三，浸泡洗也，水火共制二，蒸煮也，酒制升提，姜制温散。入盐走肾而软坚。用醋注肝而收敛。童便制，除劣性而降下，米泔制，去燥性而和中，乳制润枯生血，蜜制甘缓益元。陈壁土制，藉土气以补中州。面裹曲制，抑酷性勿伤上膈。黑豆甘草汤渍，并解毒致平和，羊酥猪脂涂烧，咸渗骨容易脆断，去穰者免胀，去心者除烦，此制治各有所宜也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240124082712-6kvln90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124082712-6kvln90","updated":"20240124090454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.1、中药制法，有水制三种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浸、泡、洗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，浸就是浸水几天，泡就是简单泡一下，洗则是洗一下；水火共制两种，为蒸和煮；"}]},{"ID":"20240124084835-valkohm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124084835-valkohm","updated":"20240124091001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"所有药，如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酒制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，取的是升提的药性，让药性往上走；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"姜制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"则温散；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"盐炒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"则走肾而软坚；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"醋制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"则收敛；如是用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"童便制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（童子尿），则除劣性而降下；如是用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"米汤（洗过米的水）制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，就是去药的燥性；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（羊奶或牛奶），则是取药的滋润性；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"陈壁土制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（以前的黄土墙壁的土），籍土气补中州（中焦肠胃）；如是用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"面裹，再用曲制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的，则是用于缓解烈药的药性；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黑豆或甘草制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"则解毒；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"动物脂肪涂抹煅烧制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，则是让药物能脆断；如是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"禾茎花果去芯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，则是为了去胀（如患者腹胀，去芯可以去胀），如患者烦躁，莲子应该去芯；"}]},{"ID":"20240124085000-brr1fwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124085000-brr1fwc","updated":"20240124090457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.2、姜制过的药物，生姜可以去解它们非常多的药物的毒，同时，生姜制过就是要取它温散，有的时候，我们病人咳嗽，是寒咳嘛，寒湿在里面，我们需要温来散它。这时我们用姜半夏。"}]},{"ID":"20240124084838-0tf6g6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124084838-0tf6g6z","updated":"20240130165257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"神农本草经分为上中下经，上经的药是无毒的，常吃养身延年（不能过食）；中经的药治（大）病；下经药多有毒，不可久服（欲除寒热的邪气，破积聚肿瘤，靠的下经药）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240124091659-5oe9q8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124091659-5oe9q8m","updated":"20240124093802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、丹砂/朱砂是生用的，熟用杀人；丹砂是最好的安眠药；"}]},{"ID":"20240124092805-9vjpkv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124092805-9vjpkv6","updated":"20240124094327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、常吃宵夜易得糖尿病；"}]},{"ID":"20240124094327-micbre9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124094327-micbre9","updated":"20240124100114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、一般来说所有的金石类的药，，都是放在铁锅里面煅，就是就直接放在铁锅里面什么都不放，直接生烤成红色的以后，等它冷，冷了以后把它拿出来打碎，这就是炮制过了。炮制过以后质会很轻很细打成粉，很好吞。"}]},{"ID":"20240124100045-esnc6te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124100045-esnc6te","updated":"20240124104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、大黄去实，芒硝攻坚（软坚），去实和攻坚定义是不一样的；大黄芒硝同用，如大便干硬，用芒硝能软之，大黄能把它打下来；"}]},{"ID":"20240124103228-9qibel9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124103228-9qibel9","updated":"20240124105136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、芒硝主六腑积结，胆，小肠，胃，大肠，膀胱，通通可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240124105136-2qu64j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124105136-2qu64j0","updated":"20240124105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、芒硝用时不煮，煮了就没有力量，都是冲下去吃的。"}]},{"ID":"20240124105139-3172rth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124105139-3172rth","updated":"20240124110253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、微咸是能够引火下行，大咸能助火生发。所以芒硝能降气分之热，是治热要药的，与大黄是入血分治火的药不同"}]},{"ID":"20240124110248-bquje2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240124110248-bquje2t","updated":"20240125093058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、热症，小便不利常用滑石；结石类症状常用滑石；"}]},{"ID":"20240125093044-3t07os4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125093044-3t07os4","updated":"20240125105249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"眼科外用药：炉甘石1两，硼砂1两，海螵蛸1两，煮水，瓢去杂质，滴眼用，也可加一点点朱砂润滑（凉后再加，朱砂不宜高温）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240125094002-50siiel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125094002-50siiel","updated":"20240125094436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、石类药大部分适合磨粉杀虫，力道较强；"}]},{"ID":"20240125094436-zmwi9vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125094436-zmwi9vx","updated":"20240125094939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、重咸的药常用于攻坚，微咸的药入肾涩精；"}]},{"ID":"20240125094939-8hvi9u3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125094939-8hvi9u3","updated":"20240125095804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、八纲辨证之表实（皮肤表面实堵到了，汗不容易出去），之里实（如里面便秘堵到了）；实又有寒热的说法，如一个人大肠没有蠕动，为寒，有蠕动，为热，没蠕动又排不出来，即为寒实，有蠕动又排不出来，热实；"}]},{"ID":"20240125103110-ocppdut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125103110-ocppdut","updated":"20240125103341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40.1、阳虚之人见阴症，阴虚之人见阳症；（如一个人静静坐着，没有活力不爱动，阳虚；如一个人满面红光，声大心急，口干舌燥，阴虚；）"}]},{"ID":"20240126151321-6vse28f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126151321-6vse28f","updated":"20240126151356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40.2、眼睛看得到的为阴，眼睛看不到的为阳；（例肌肉为阴，肌肉内包含的力量为阳）"}]},{"ID":"20240125095805-i9ace2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125095805-i9ace2o","updated":"20240125100146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、禹馀粮是涩药，实热者禁用；"}]},{"ID":"20240125100147-ulkf8j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125100147-ulkf8j0","updated":"20240125102845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、热药能让病人容易怀孕——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20240125102845-jpol3hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125102845-jpol3hs","updated":"20240125105004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"发炎型的下痢（血便混合），严重乃至脱肛，可用赤石脂（涩剂）；赤石脂+禹馀粮对下痢效果显著；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240125094153-97dpk7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125094153-97dpk7u","updated":"20240125104622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、赤石脂常用于肠炎，大便带血，但不是实症的情况；"}]},{"ID":"20240125104517-fn0d4v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125104517-fn0d4v2","updated":"20240125104911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、下痢水痢一般用白术茯苓利小便，小便利后大便就正常了；"}]},{"ID":"20240125104911-07j3szf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125104911-07j3szf","updated":"20240125141644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鼻炎方：辛夷菖蒲苍术汤（辛夷2钱菖蒲3钱苍术3钱），该方不论寒热皆可用，如考虑寒热，寒可加味干姜，热可加味杏仁，如有心脏问题，不加辛夷，重用菖蒲；麝香矾石散（无孔不入，钻通九窍）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240125104034-b0wqdjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125104034-b0wqdjv","updated":"20240125111133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、菖蒲可解巴豆大戟毒，常喝菖蒲水不会腹痛，因为菖蒲本身可解毒，常与辛夷花并用；（巴豆中毒喝冷水也能解）"}]},{"ID":"20240125110924-p2avp4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125110924-p2avp4n","updated":"20240125141000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、菊花小朵的好用，但陈年菊花不好用；嚼碎敷在伤口上可以解毒收敛伤口，新鲜菊叶解毒功能更佳；头痛、晕眩、外感、生眼翳都可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240125114429-56hlta7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125114429-56hlta7","updated":"20240125141721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、人参中，红参较好，性温力量强；人参切片含口中可生津止渴提神；"}]},{"ID":"20240125141630-07udxz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125141630-07udxz6","updated":"20240125142140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、没有办法取到人参的时候，我们可以用黄芪，这就是重点，黄芪、甘草来取代人参，这个功能，因为它补气行气；"}]},{"ID":"20240125142140-h9vxxad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125142140-h9vxxad","updated":"20240125144342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、久咳的肺会气管破裂积淤，所以开处方时，除开去痰、止咳、去血的药，同时还要开活血化淤的药；甘草这味药，也能吐肺的脓血；"}]},{"ID":"20240125144343-4sa23al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125144343-4sa23al","updated":"20240125145356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、过食云石（如白石英、紫石英、硫磺）等药中毒，皮肤痒，红疹，舌头麻、头皮发麻等症状可用甘草解；甘草用于解毒常用生甘草；"}]},{"ID":"20240125144819-m8rm33g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125144819-m8rm33g","updated":"20240125150356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、女人常用生地，男人常用熟地，生地倾向于补血凉血，熟地倾向于补血补脾胃补肾顾精；"}]},{"ID":"20240125142123-xrj67vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125142123-xrj67vh","updated":"20240125151220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术去湿，附子去寒，术附汤也被称为排脓汤，身体有脓往骨头里面长时，可以用术附汤排出；白术也可以打粉外敷在疮疡上去脓；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240125151312-z99tn31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125151312-z99tn31","updated":"20240125151327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54.1、消炎：去热的药+去湿的药"}]},{"ID":"20240125150954-dn28ma4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125150954-dn28ma4","updated":"20240125152206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、白术能通利三焦，让水道通畅；所以白术是补脾重药，也是利水的主药；"}]},{"ID":"20240125152206-sedgbsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125152206-sedgbsk","updated":"20240125152356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、中药取得是它的中性，因为人体是精密的，能利用药味自我调节，如小便不利可以用白术，小便利也可以用白术；"}]},{"ID":"20240125152417-hyon6yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125152417-hyon6yf","updated":"20240125153105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56.1、使用中药的目的是让你身体所有的东西都能被你自己所掌控，对你的身体进行强化，所以吃了中药以后，你是自我恢复的，所以用痊愈二字；"}]},{"ID":"20240125152356-uom4e81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125152356-uom4e81","updated":"20240125161553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、菟丝子常用于不举以及精不足，如果仅仅是精不足，不能用菟丝子，会导致不举；"}]},{"ID":"20240125161555-yay2uwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125161555-yay2uwc","updated":"20240125162018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、牛膝孕妇不能吃，吃了会下胎；且牛膝用药时量要够，如小孩可以用3钱，遇到体格较大的，5钱以上钱都没关系，适量加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240125162259-qoxms5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125162259-qoxms5y","updated":"20240125162309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58.1、牛膝这味药攻中带补；"}]},{"ID":"20240125162013-lhh4qky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125162013-lhh4qky","updated":"20240125164800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、玉竹能美容，可以常吃（如可炖鸡汤），属于上经药味；"}]},{"ID":"20240125164657-nvyosmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125164657-nvyosmy","updated":"20240125171153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、柴胡是半表半里的药，半表半里的症状就是往来寒热；柴胡适用骨蒸，不过治疗骨蒸银柴胡更好用；"}]},{"ID":"20240125171613-afvm487","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125171613-afvm487","updated":"20240126095011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、例治疗阳虚，需要行阳+补虚的药一起作用；例治疗虚热，需要补虚+去热药一起作用；例治疗实热，需要去实+去热的药一起作用；（仅举例，临床上可能会阳药滋阴）"}]},{"ID":"20240125171817-yq0ycgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125171817-yq0ycgo","updated":"20240125173849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、麦门冬是润肺清火的要药，专门治肺中伏火痰多，津少口渴或舌苔黄腻干咳（绝对处方：麦门冬汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240125173653-3rlf516","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125173653-3rlf516","updated":"20240125175303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、祛风的药，风吹它的时候这种本草药不会晃动，无风时才会晃动（如独活、天麻、白头翁）；"}]},{"ID":"20240125175423-8lbh5sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125175423-8lbh5sr","updated":"20240125175530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.1、游走性的痛，可以用祛风药，如独活；"}]},{"ID":"20240125175646-95ldm9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125175646-95ldm9f","updated":"20240125175710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.2、巧用：望诊，很多老先生，他年龄大退休，你看他走路，关节都很紧，肩膀都绷着，这样抖啊，这个风痛，可以用祛风药独活；"}]},{"ID":"20240125175227-u6ammj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125175227-u6ammj2","updated":"20240125175926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、实痛虚痛辨别：实痛痛感较强，虚痛痛感隐隐作痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240125175927-rz42oms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240125175927-rz42oms","updated":"20240126084226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、木香能对治呕吐下利，旅行时可携带以防吃坏肚子；木香久服无梦；木香能行气散郁；"}]},{"ID":"20240126083856-l2nqk8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126083856-l2nqk8i","updated":"20240126084806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、行气可用木香，行血可用白芍；（如气闷住，一般用木香；如月经痛，一般用白芍）"}]},{"ID":"20240126084344-qukd4f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126084344-qukd4f5","updated":"20240126095207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、肿块溃疡可以将生淮山（薯蓣）锤碎外敷；"}]},{"ID":"20240126095207-zs5d3im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126095207-zs5d3im","updated":"20240126095956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、一般来说孕妇禁忌的药，都是能够活血化瘀的药，能够排淤血的药，大部分要禁掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240126102509-igfbewv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126102509-igfbewv","updated":"20240126102634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、抽筋如用蔗糖、甘味药没用，那可能是寒导致，抽起来会非常痛，要用热药才有用；"}]},{"ID":"20240126102636-el02w2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126102636-el02w2v","updated":"20240126111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、泽泻患者阴虚忌用，薏仁阴虚反而好用些，因为带有滋阴的效果；"}]},{"ID":"20240126111653-omkqi1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126111653-omkqi1a","updated":"20240126112140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、肌肉跳动，说明有陈水在里面；"}]},{"ID":"20240126112141-3rsdw98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126112141-3rsdw98","updated":"20240126113636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、解酒：苍术+泽泻；"}]},{"ID":"20240126113636-tt51kuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126113636-tt51kuz","updated":"20240126114134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三年生附子，三年不收四年采收则是乌头，四年不收五年收则是天雄；（大热大毒）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240126114033-nm16fiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126114033-nm16fiq","updated":"20240202154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大热大毒的药，那你吃下去的话，病人伤到，会有后遗症，伤到心脏，心脏会瓣膜闭锁不全，伤到心脏，心肌有问题，受伤，心脏会绞痛，心脏会空空的感觉，因为病人会心里不舒服，代表中毒，弥补的方式，就是远志，单味的药，开个远志五钱，三碗水煮成一碗，吃个几包就好了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240126114158-yfkam0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126114158-yfkam0q","updated":"20240202154736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.2、远志是治疗心脏病很好的药，能治心惊动悸；强心益智；远志能解乌头附子毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240126113948-avwf8bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126113948-avwf8bv","updated":"20240126144432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、龙胆草，大寒药，可去目中黄及睛赤肿胀，退肝经邪热，除下焦湿热之肿，泻膀胱之火。如治眼睛红肿赤痛，可将龙胆草用酒浸，这样药性往上不下沉；"}]},{"ID":"20240126144433-ay5w1c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126144433-ay5w1c0","updated":"20240126144742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、少阴证头痛，用细辛对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240126144742-96sor2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126144742-96sor2z","updated":"20240126150041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、阳明无死症。阴症出现才会有死症。有阴虚，有阴实，像虚很好治，补一下就回来了，难的是实。"}]},{"ID":"20240126150042-vo8k531","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126150042-vo8k531","updated":"20240126150309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、细辛是阳药，热药，风痛、头痛、关节痛，通通可以用细辛；风湿、头痛、痹痛，开窍行水；"}]},{"ID":"20240126150158-52vbw17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126150158-52vbw17","updated":"20240126151829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、舌苔是胃气所在，有一点舌苔是正常的，如没有舌苔只剩绛红色说明胃气跑掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20240126151306-yntvnb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126151306-yntvnb4","updated":"20240126152156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、石斛能治胃中大热（舌苔粘腻），可以滋阴降火；（胃热表现，胃口异常大，胃寒的人大部分是瘦子）"}]},{"ID":"20240126152313-pch8ays","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126152313-pch8ays","updated":"20240126152345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79.1、减肥方法之一：用药让人胃寒，祛湿；"}]},{"ID":"20240126152345-a0jr192","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126152345-a0jr192","updated":"20240126163116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、巴戟天，补肾壮阳固精健骨知名阳药；发散力道强，大风邪气重病皆可用；常用于不孕（男女皆可）；"}]},{"ID":"20240126153640-nq8jwwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126153640-nq8jwwn","updated":"20240126153703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、壮阳同时要固阳，不然阳会泻；"}]},{"ID":"20240126170116-epeexw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126170116-epeexw7","updated":"20240126170135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、天麻能滋润津液，能让人皮肤变好；"}]},{"ID":"20240126170130-y7vvh6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126170130-y7vvh6p","updated":"20240126172410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、卷柏，生用药性平，主破血通经；炙用治疗肠风脱肛；卷柏，可去脸上黑斑；"}]},{"ID":"20240126172305-5h08a9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126172305-5h08a9p","updated":"20240129091711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、蓝实（青黛）解毒很强，可外敷内服（生用），瘟疫瘴疫蛇虫中毒可用；带状疱疹腰蛇毒，胸蛇锦蛇中毒可在患处撒青黛粉（可头尾两头灸或棉花撕薄火烧，迅速烧过再用青黛粉敷）；"}]},{"ID":"20240126173035-a0av3se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126173035-a0av3se","updated":"20240129105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、中了乌头毒怎么解？服用青黛，如外伤有乌头毒，则外敷青黛+内服；远志也可以；防风也可以；"}]},{"ID":"20240129090503-ygywvs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129090503-ygywvs6","updated":"20240129092156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、遇到任何肝病，川穹都要用——倪师；辨证用之；"}]},{"ID":"20240129090513-az4usvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129090513-az4usvu","updated":"20240129092803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、黄连四川的较好；"}]},{"ID":"20240129093431-fbjmkf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129093431-fbjmkf0","updated":"20240129093821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"口疮，可用单味五倍子打粉，棉棒沾粉涂在疮口上；黄连也可以，黄连苦，可以考虑先用五倍子；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129093505-zc0f9k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129093505-zc0f9k3","updated":"20240129095205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"喉癌，舌癌，口腔癌之类疾病导致不能吃东西，单味络石藤煮水，让病人一点点慢慢吞，开喉；如络石藤无效，用硝石；半夏苦酒汤（让肿瘤收敛，使喉咙打开）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129095259-puq8s5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129095259-puq8s5f","updated":"20240129095315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89.1、乳癌，通乳上面的时候，硬块上面，也会开到络石藤，但是要用在热症上；"}]},{"ID":"20240129095006-7s4xlht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129095006-7s4xlht","updated":"20240129095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、年久失明：蒺藜阴干捣散吃；"}]},{"ID":"20240129095751-s4hjaut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129095751-s4hjaut","updated":"20240129095808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90.1、睛球凹陷，睛生障翳，视物模糊：白蒺藜；"}]},{"ID":"20240129093737-cnh3hq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129093737-cnh3hq4","updated":"20240129101434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、怀孕不能过食黄芪，会导致气旺血衰下胎；但可少量服用；"}]},{"ID":"20240129101434-txqs6wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129101434-txqs6wp","updated":"20240129101538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91.1、孕期早餐豆浆+少量黄芪+蔗糖，小孩生下来皮肤雪白；"}]},{"ID":"20240129101538-fc29phk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129101538-fc29phk","updated":"20240129101815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91.2、唐容川认定黄耆是三焦的良药，能拓里达表，虚症积水的时候，一定会用到黄耆；"}]},{"ID":"20240129101811-b9cjosl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129101811-b9cjosl","updated":"20240129102458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、精少\\生精：肉苁蓉；"}]},{"ID":"20240129103133-i4pj546","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129103133-i4pj546","updated":"20240129103156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、维他命C吃多易得肾结石，乳房硬块；"}]},{"ID":"20240129105214-ye82xmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129105214-ye82xmm","updated":"20240129111536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、防风与黄芪相辅相成，如果不加防风，黄芪药性走得快，不能很好的定点治疗，防风可牵扯黄芪让黄芪力道更专一，去除肌纤维痛速度很快；"}]},{"ID":"20240129105803-w0jdn65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129105803-w0jdn65","updated":"20240129111858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、防风，治风祛湿仙药——刘元素；"}]},{"ID":"20240129111858-3g8kcq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129111858-3g8kcq9","updated":"20240129112950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、蒲黄粉，活血化瘀止血，炒熟炒黑止血效果最好；"}]},{"ID":"20240129112951-ralwubh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129112951-ralwubh","updated":"20240129114209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、续断该药多用于金疮折跌，补益筋骨，破淤生新；"}]},{"ID":"20240129142921-up9id33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129142921-up9id33","updated":"20240129143100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、口舌糜烂，陈年老疮，吞咽痛苦，可以用营实打粉吞服对治，煮成汤药含服也可以；"}]},{"ID":"20240129142947-fj4rgmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129142947-fj4rgmt","updated":"20240129144312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、肿瘤良恶性区分，触摸法，表面粗糙不疼且硬的一般是恶性的，表面光滑摸起来会移动且疼的，一般是良性的；"}]},{"ID":"20240129144312-jmgem7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129144312-jmgem7i","updated":"20240129144703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、决明子，可泻肝明目益精；"}]},{"ID":"20240129144703-tv7egzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129144703-tv7egzl","updated":"20240129145246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、丹参可活血化瘀，利水利气，固胎安胎；中医有一句话，丹参一味可以抵四物汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240129144924-o08pywj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129144924-o08pywj","updated":"20240129150303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、茜草能收敛能攻坚，如腹痛不明状况，可开茜草；"}]},{"ID":"20240129150339-ibg0wf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129150339-ibg0wf8","updated":"20240129150358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102.1、茜草又名血见愁，任何血病遇到茜草都有一定的疗效；"}]},{"ID":"20240129150304-ioq5t0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129150304-ioq5t0z","updated":"20240129150509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黑发方：茜草一斤，生地三斤，加水熬成膏，每天半勺，一个月白发变黑发；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129144712-wdy78nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129144712-wdy78nc","updated":"20240129151008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、五味子，酸苦甘辛咸味，入五脏，以酸味为主；"}]},{"ID":"20240129151735-q1ac2gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129151735-q1ac2gk","updated":"20240129152034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、旋覆花可强壮，续筋骨，合金疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240129151433-l3h9hrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129151433-l3h9hrs","updated":"20240129151733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105.1、旋覆花女人常吃皮肤会变得光鲜亮丽；"}]},{"ID":"20240129151849-xd3paj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129151849-xd3paj4","updated":"20240129152953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、Ⅰ型的糖尿病是被西医制造出来，使人体胰脏功能消失，形成终生胰岛素依赖（短命）；Ⅱ型糖尿病是自身造成（富贵病），例常吃宵夜；Ⅱ型糖尿病相对容易治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20240129152827-wwfw43q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129152827-wwfw43q","updated":"20240129160007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、蛇床子止痒效果很强，可打粉使用，如阴部瘙痒，涂上去立即就不痒了；专治下体湿热湿毒之痒；"}]},{"ID":"20240129160008-cwq2mgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129160008-cwq2mgj","updated":"20240129160609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、毒蜂、蝎子、蜘蛛咬伤，烫伤，刀疮刀伤，用景天外敷；"}]},{"ID":"20240129160743-yrkiled","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129160743-yrkiled","updated":"20240129160816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、一般来说外用药的时候都是熟用，所谓熟用就是炮制，烤过烤干了，炒干了也可以，反正把水分去掉，弄干了以后打粉，打粉以后变成细粉出来敷在外面，外敷用哦很好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240129160816-25w6ohy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129160816-25w6ohy","updated":"20240129161131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、茵陈蒿，治黄要药；与黄芪不同，黄芪退的黄是三焦的黄，流汗出来会把衣服染色掉，茵陈退的黄是肝胆病的黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240129161202-spel8c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129161202-spel8c3","updated":"20240129161236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110.1、还有一种黄是血虚的黄，手掌暗黄淡黄，没有血色，治疗这种黄补血即可；"}]},{"ID":"20240129161239-oil4tjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129161239-oil4tjo","updated":"20240131142106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、药性微寒的药，都能用于消炎，且微寒的药都是能长期吃的；"}]},{"ID":"20240129161802-krtl02d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129161802-krtl02d","updated":"20240129163500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏相克并不是指克制，而是制衡的作用；本草药物中，能够润肺能够补肺气的都能够对肝脏都很好，同样的任何对肝脏很好的，都会对脾脏很好。任何对脾脏很好的都会对肾脏很好，任何对肾脏很好的都会对心脏很好，只要能对心脏很好的都能对肺脏很好，那就是相克的关系。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129163457-ossiqr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129163457-ossiqr2","updated":"20240129164903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、专门治疟中药：常山、云实；"}]},{"ID":"20240129164852-eweqvot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164852-eweqvot","updated":"20240129165826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、升麻是一个疮家的圣药，身上生疮哦，恶疮，脓疮，牙齿牙龈的毁损，通通都可以使用升麻。解毒去热的力量非常的强；阳明经长红斑也可用升麻升阳发散之；可外敷内服，外敷+内服效果最佳；"}]},{"ID":"20240129165826-1wp4exm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129165826-1wp4exm","updated":"20240129170439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、孕期不出奶民间方法：葱白切开在乳头涂抹下，然后再用葱的根须在乳头刷一刷，马上有奶；"}]},{"ID":"20240129170439-99j9e0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129170439-99j9e0a","updated":"20240129171128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116、动脉是从心脏到四肢末梢去的，静脉是从四肢末梢回心脏的，如果我们把那个血液循环系统切成两半，以桂枝与芍药论，桂枝的话主的就是动脉，白芍的话主的就是静脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240129171129-jgxwtv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129171129-jgxwtv6","updated":"20240129172737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肉桂一般生用，煮的话味道会发散掉，用的话可以生肉桂打粉撒在药上喝；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129172905-bjnpf1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129172905-bjnpf1f","updated":"20240129172921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117.1、张仲景用肉桂的时候他一定用附子，为什么？你光靠一个肉桂下去没有用，所以肉桂跟附子我们常常用在一起，肉桂下去点火啦，附子来固阳，固住它不会往外散。"}]},{"ID":"20240129172724-qsvyxop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129172724-qsvyxop","updated":"20240130084309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、松脂去杀虫，去风、寒、湿；松节可以酿酒来矫骨节痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240129171055-bbtxtfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129171055-bbtxtfh","updated":"20240130085244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、凡是能够凉血的，都有消炎镇痛的功能"}]},{"ID":"20240130085245-og4drq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130085245-og4drq3","updated":"20240130085549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、痔疮，内外痔：槐实熬膏，可内服，可塞入肛门里，双管齐下效果更好；槐花炒菜吃也能治痔疮；"}]},{"ID":"20240130085348-6hb472v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130085348-6hb472v","updated":"20240130085800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、枸杞这个本草植物的子就是枸杞，它的树根就是地骨皮；"}]},{"ID":"20240130085800-beu3sk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130085800-beu3sk9","updated":"20240130090000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、我们治疗心脏的时候，所有红色的药，一进来的时候，一定会去润肺"}]},{"ID":"20240130090028-fq3nhmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130090028-fq3nhmc","updated":"20240130090039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122.1、中医在治疗心脏病，第一个我们要去治金，所以把肺弄好，心脏就会好。"}]},{"ID":"20240130090037-yqmiwrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130090037-yqmiwrm","updated":"20240130090759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、生发剂：当归+侧柏叶（久服）；可加味何首乌（让发质变好）；"}]},{"ID":"20240130090605-nm4fitt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130090605-nm4fitt","updated":"20240130091709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、茯苓是利水利小便代表药，正常来说利尿剂会导致口渴，茯苓不但利尿，还能生津止渴；"}]},{"ID":"20240130091244-86cv22l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130091244-86cv22l","updated":"20240130092200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、全身性水肿的时候，因为毛孔呼吸不是很好，因为积水了嘛，只有靠肺来呼吸，病人都会走两步就会喘得厉害；"}]},{"ID":"20240130092154-19orq28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130092154-19orq28","updated":"20240130092436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、五皮饮：利水消肿要药；"}]},{"ID":"20240130092436-zx9p2y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130092436-zx9p2y9","updated":"20240130100616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"防蚊：肉桂+艾草煮水，装喷壶里喷射使用；麻油擦身体表面；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240130100612-5oy5yt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130100612-5oy5yt9","updated":"20240130101504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、收妊辰纹、生了小孩后腰骨痛、骨断骨折：可用杜仲；"}]},{"ID":"20240130101442-jpe59rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130101442-jpe59rq","updated":"20240130101457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128.1、杜仲：胎前能安胎，胎后能补；"}]},{"ID":"20240130101042-n54qwbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130101042-n54qwbs","updated":"20240130111408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、诸邪深入，或内病暴作，所有的经络堵塞，那外窍也闭塞，心神失其主，病人胡言乱语，讲什么他也听不到，鼻子不闻香臭，心神已失，眼睛也看不到了，大小便不是失禁就是不出来，代表里面经络都闭塞住。这个时候非麝香不可；"}]},{"ID":"20240130111408-08579jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130111408-08579jn","updated":"20240130112410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、鹿角阳热过重，靠近男人阳物的话会造成阳痿；"}]},{"ID":"20240130112410-in47vuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130112410-in47vuq","updated":"20240130112855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、月经不能吃阿胶，阿胶收敛血力道很强，吃了阿胶会导致月经提前停止；如果月经期间吃了仍然正常，说明患者血虚；"}]},{"ID":"20240130112937-t0xrp82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130112937-t0xrp82","updated":"20240130113141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131.1、倪师临床患者经期吃阿胶不少月经正常的，阿胶一般是身体不正常才会用到，自然有补益作用，身体正常没必要吃，吃了经停；"}]},{"ID":"20240130112810-ncy7liw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130112810-ncy7liw","updated":"20240130114258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、救急方——古人急救吊死或勒死之人时，将活雄鸡一只，腹部切开，趁热直接放置到死人的脖子位置，病患保持平躺姿势，可以救助于危急之时。"}]},{"ID":"20240130112337-trmg3wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130112337-trmg3wh","updated":"20240130141649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、止血方：刀创伤口，蔗糖敷可止血，干了再换，大约三天，疤痕都没有；"}]},{"ID":"20240130141803-9dllvf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130141803-9dllvf5","updated":"20240130141910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134.1、蜂窝组织炎，蔗糖泡水用于泡脚，脓会从伤口中喷射出；"}]},{"ID":"20240130141549-dcthabm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130141549-dcthabm","updated":"20240130142145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蚂蚁或其他昆虫进耳朵怎么办？手捂住另一边的耳朵，让里面没有空气，蚂蚁就会自己爬出来；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240130142141-ciqszh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130142141-ciqszh9","updated":"20240130143202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、白头发拔掉后，再发根位置点一点蜂蜡，之后就能生出黑发来；"}]},{"ID":"20240130143202-c2qezib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130143202-c2qezib","updated":"20240130144100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、小孩头顶软骨密合不好，可以用龟甲对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240130144100-4ba0crj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130144100-4ba0crj","updated":"20240130144758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨头突出且感觉刺痛：单味川芎粉，川芎粉拿那个棉布包，然后喷点米酒上去，米酒能够加强……温中嘛，加强药以后，然后晚上可以贴上去，贴到脚上去，贴到骨头肿起来的地方，然后早上起来把它拿掉，每天晚上贴，每天晚上贴。那你一包可能用一钱粉在里面，这很多了嘛，你用到两三四天以后，味道没有了，代表药力过了，你再拿一包来贴；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240130144721-k43hpvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130144721-k43hpvv","updated":"20240130144948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、脂肪瘤：蓖麻籽磨膏贴在患处，一段时间即可消掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240130144948-ynfewp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130144948-ynfewp4","updated":"20240130145655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、鲤鱼主湿痹，面目浮肿，全身积水都可使用，以黑鲤鱼最好用；"}]},{"ID":"20240130145512-40p3hcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130145512-40p3hcg","updated":"20240130161139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、中医是在用汗、吐、下三种方法在治病；"}]},{"ID":"20240130161139-7fql603","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130161139-7fql603","updated":"20240130161432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、红枣可以杀乌头附子天雄毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240130161406-dct1o3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130161406-dct1o3p","updated":"20240130162743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"发落不生：麻子仁研汁煮粥；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240130162733-hlp86yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130162733-hlp86yl","updated":"20240130163954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、在主治的上焦的实症以吐取之;"}]},{"ID":"20240130163954-q619mql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130163954-q619mql","updated":"20240130164125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生病或误用药导致呕吐不止，可用半夏止吐；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240130164100-luldgw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130164100-luldgw8","updated":"20240130165649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、雄黄解毒力道强，蚀疮杀虫要药，能辟邪气；雄黄本身有毒，不可过服；"}]},{"ID":"20240131092456-inb4cef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131092456-inb4cef","updated":"20240131092518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145.1、雄黄一加热烧过，黑黑的成分就是砒霜；"}]},{"ID":"20240130165649-fyt3sfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130165649-fyt3sfl","updated":"20240130171124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、褥疮：撒雄黄粉；（雄黄粉能清褥疮，但清掉后不要再用，因为力道强，再用可能会把好肉再给清掉，没有臭味就代表坏肉清掉了；个人感觉可以配合生脉散使用）"}]},{"ID":"20240130171012-o97umae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130171012-o97umae","updated":"20240131085156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、硫磺属于大热药，比附子还热，祛寒燥湿，杀虫化金；（这里的硫磺治石硫磺，土硫磺不可服用，剧毒）"}]},{"ID":"20240131083818-8ueim8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131083818-8ueim8m","updated":"20240131083828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.1、硫磺中毒可吃鸭肉解；"}]},{"ID":"20240131085100-0kb9sbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131085100-0kb9sbp","updated":"20240131085123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.2、硫磺炮制后补阳力道很强，生用时攻坚力道很强；"}]},{"ID":"20240131085825-9x0dj0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131085825-9x0dj0w","updated":"20240131085841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.3、烫伤：可用硫磺膏或者硫磺粉外敷；"}]},{"ID":"20240131090415-nla59gj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131090415-nla59gj","updated":"20240131090426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.4、吃硫磺我们治疗全身性的水肿，一剂下去的时候是汗流浃背，小便一直出来，同时发生；"}]},{"ID":"20240130172210-s5aqwjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130172210-s5aqwjp","updated":"20240131092352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、雌黄或雄黄用于洗头，可杀虫；"}]},{"ID":"20240131092216-djx4x0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131092216-djx4x0z","updated":"20240131092950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、阳不举，用巴戟天、肉苁蓉，菟丝子、覆盆子都无效的话，用硫磺；"}]},{"ID":"20240131092952-k8f46xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131092952-k8f46xo","updated":"20240131093532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"在经方里面，石膏白色称为白虎，麻黄青色称为青龙，红枣（大枣）红色称为朱雀，附子黑色称之为玄武。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240131093502-t9mxbwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131093502-t9mxbwa","updated":"20240131093825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、石膏色白味甘辛，是大寒药；清凉解热要药；"}]},{"ID":"20240131100008-5ksc8vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131100008-5ksc8vi","updated":"20240131100120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、中消，吃东西仍然觉得饿觉得渴，可能是胃热，可用石膏去热生津，如果石膏递增使用无效，用热药；"}]},{"ID":"20240131100112-y7mgt9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131100112-y7mgt9g","updated":"20240131101044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、慈石是补肾壮阳的药，同时能够让肾气归，元气归为肾脏的药；（慈石：天然磁铁）"}]},{"ID":"20240131101006-rcelxbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131101006-rcelxbf","updated":"20240131101022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153.1、过去泡酒会加一点磁石在里面；"}]},{"ID":"20240131101022-vagy0dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131101022-vagy0dt","updated":"20240131101858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、阳起石是补命门，壮阳道的要药，功能疗阴痿，男女都可以使用；攻坚，肿瘤的时候都可用到；"}]},{"ID":"20240131101847-yztij2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131101847-yztij2u","updated":"20240131102208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、主崩中漏下，如持续来月经流血，子宫颈癌，无毒，所以许多癌症都可以用到阳起石；"}]},{"ID":"20240131101629-56aftsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131101629-56aftsy","updated":"20240131104846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、所有的吐血咳血，第一个就想到干姜，一般是里面有寒（寒，则血管破裂有血溢出）；（当然也有温病派认为是因为里热导致吐血）"}]},{"ID":"20240131104405-j26o3u3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131104405-j26o3u3","updated":"20240131114505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、葛根发汗解肌升阳散火，项强常用；"}]},{"ID":"20240131114508-m5ay9ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131114508-m5ay9ws","updated":"20240131114518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156.1、张仲景葛根汤，就是温病第一方；"}]},{"ID":"20240131113345-32vdg0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131113345-32vdg0t","updated":"20240131114521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156.2、有一种痉病，突然之间昏厥了，全身绷紧角弓反张，弯过去，为什么，因为脑部的津液没有了，水没了，脑部里头没有水啊，所以你摸到头是凉的啊，头顶没有水，那如果哪里津液不够了，堵在项这边，没有办法上来了，那脑部里面不单单是缺氧，津液不足的时候，人会抽筋，抽搐起来的时候角弓反张，好像癫痫一样，这样，整个这样身体反过来，本来手脚在前面，手往后翻，这样翻过去，中医称之为刚痉，这个时候呢，也是要靠葛根，唯一的药，葛根把津液提升起来，从肾脏提升起来，直接把那个水提到脑部去，让脑部得到充足的水分，痉的现象就会，抽筋的现象就会解除掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240131113358-a1p4u1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131113358-a1p4u1b","updated":"20240131114057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、葛根的根比较实，里面很扎实，所以，升津，津液会往上升，不升气；升麻也是，那里面是空的，所以升麻的孔道能行气，升麻是升气不升津；"}]},{"ID":"20240131114057-puy0b5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131114057-puy0b5c","updated":"20240131141510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、瓜蒌根，经方家在治疗柔痉，第一处方；"}]},{"ID":"20240131141547-je0ixji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131141547-je0ixji","updated":"20240131141640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"该味本草经方家用的非常广，几乎所有消渴、糖尿病、口渴都在用瓜蒌根，几乎所有心脏病、胸痹都在用瓜蒌实；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240131141816-oryqkb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131141816-oryqkb6","updated":"20240131141822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158.2、瓜蒌根主治消渴的力量比葛根还好。葛根呢，它的津液是在后项，从太阳经上来，在脖子上面，津液上来到脑部去，瓜蒌根不是，直接从任脉跑到喉咙，一吃下去，马上津液就生出来了，津液就生出来了；"}]},{"ID":"20240131141511-sffkhgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131141511-sffkhgs","updated":"20240131142721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、真正的当归，如果说你那个当归拿起来都干干瘪瘪的破散开来，油脂就没掉了，没有了，这个当归就没有效了"}]},{"ID":"20240131114055-l6e9ga4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131114055-l6e9ga4","updated":"20240131144746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、治皮肤病的原则：有出血的情况或有脓疮的时候如青春痘，不要发表；（因为你一发表，脓疮的话会更多，因为你一发表水会更多，湿会更深，所以其他的皮肤病，像风疹啊，疥疮啊，湿疹都可以使用，但是就是有脓疮的时候最好不要用）"}]},{"ID":"20240131144724-mtzkq5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131144724-mtzkq5h","updated":"20240131151721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、麻黄能够宣肺，能够把肺气打开；"}]},{"ID":"20240131151715-jzo335h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131151715-jzo335h","updated":"20240131151718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161.1、麻黄的节是止汗的，麻黄的茎是发汗的；"}]},{"ID":"20240131151523-ji7gkja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131151523-ji7gkja","updated":"20240131152303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、白芍赤芍其实是一样的东西；（芍药花的根，一般是白色的，切开有时候看到红色的，叫赤芍，实际上差不了多少）"}]},{"ID":"20240131152426-3cca2eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131152426-3cca2eb","updated":"20240131152938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162.1、芍药花开时，红色的芍药又入血分又收敛；脚有静脉瘤的时候，你需要一个药来收敛它，唯一能够收敛，把静脉瘤静脉血管收缩起来的就是一味药，白芍（如果只是用芍药治疗腹痛，三钱左右即可；如果是要收敛脚的静脉瘤，一两起跳）；"}]},{"ID":"20240131153019-p8tgx0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131153019-p8tgx0o","updated":"20240131153102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162.3、有胸满的人不用白芍，因为白芍收敛静脉血液回心脏时力量很强，胸满会变严重；"}]},{"ID":"20240131152519-tpr60r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131152519-tpr60r8","updated":"20240131153935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、止痛中药：延胡索、金铃子；（中药的吗啡）"}]},{"ID":"20240131153751-stiwu9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131153751-stiwu9e","updated":"20240131154635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、淋病忌发汗；"}]},{"ID":"20240131154635-5xvodm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131154635-5xvodm8","updated":"20240131160100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、骨头骨折的时候用续断，筋折的时候用秦艽；"}]},{"ID":"20240131160100-3e3mcfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131160100-3e3mcfk","updated":"20240131165644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、白芷，能羊绒美颜，常用于阳明头痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240131165644-t8vw9r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131165644-t8vw9r9","updated":"20240131165851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、风胜湿，所有能祛风的药都是能祛湿的药；"}]},{"ID":"20240131165851-itbiv6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131165851-itbiv6h","updated":"20240131170503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、淫羊藿，壮阳补肾固精的药，治阳痿茎痛，食用后性欲大增；"}]},{"ID":"20240131170242-zh995ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131170242-zh995ay","updated":"20240131171322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、阳强阴茎不下，可以用寒药降火，如石膏；"}]},{"ID":"20240131171323-omvwyx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131171323-omvwyx4","updated":"20240131171910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、女人怀孕期间，大部分出现的症是热症；"}]},{"ID":"20240131171910-9nw18og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131171910-9nw18og","updated":"20240131172710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、人身惟三焦是行水气的孔道哦，三焦主相火，所以火很盛的时候，黄芩可以去火，火逆呕苦，黄芩为正药；这个药呢，苦，而且颜色是带绿的，所以能入胆，胆汁呢，是绿色的，所以只要你听到病人说，哎呀，奇怪，倪老师，我的小孩子为什么大便出来是绿色的，胆汁；"}]},{"ID":"20240131172712-qt4tmaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131172712-qt4tmaw","updated":"20240131172740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171.1、所以我们治疗肝胆病，势必要用到黄芩；"}]},{"ID":"20240131172740-eaym39h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131172740-eaym39h","updated":"20240131173247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、心下痞成因举例：你感冒了，发烧，这个微烧，本来不是很严重，那中医看，这个病在表，脉都是浮的，按照《黄帝内经》，这个浮脉是表，那开点发表药就好了。结果他在煮药的时候肚子饿嘛，还有点饿，还有点胃气在那边，就跑去买个便当，那个便当是坏的，食物是坏的，一吃下去那个坏的食物造成下利。按照我们的原则，治症的时候，病人有表证的时候我们不可以攻下的，要先解表再去攻里，结果他不小心，吃了拉肚子，一下利。这个表邪一下陷，就变成“心下痞”"}]},{"ID":"20240131173248-p1rp5ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131173248-p1rp5ve","updated":"20240201091121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、白茅根，可止血利尿，如病人体内出血或淤血兼有水肿，可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240201091005-uw71jv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201091005-uw71jv7","updated":"20240201093441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、紫苑可祛痰止咳，味苦性温，但凡寒症的咳嗽，都可以用紫苑；"}]},{"ID":"20240201093442-2n6feir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201093442-2n6feir","updated":"20240201094331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、盲肠炎判断：足三里下两寸阑尾点有压痛点；"}]},{"ID":"20240201094332-s2pb728","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201094332-s2pb728","updated":"20240201095504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、一昧开补药来补是不对的，有时候也要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"以通为补"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，只要病人吃药后精神面貌变好，哪怕药方主泻的也是补药；"}]},{"ID":"20240201094519-sx3ueg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201094519-sx3ueg8","updated":"20240201100045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、白鲜皮常用于治黄（热症的黄）；"}]},{"ID":"20240201095504-fq4lzxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201095504-fq4lzxl","updated":"20240201100639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、提神定心茶（喝了心情不易烦躁，可自行加味）：杭菊+酸浆（洛神）+甘草+远志（较苦可少加）+蔗糖；"}]},{"ID":"20240201100539-7vmlaht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201100539-7vmlaht","updated":"20240201101738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179、藁本祛风散寒镇痛，可用于齿痛、阴部痛、脸上的斑、酒槽鼻等；"}]},{"ID":"20240201101739-mxaijph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201101739-mxaijph","updated":"20240201103817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、风疹，配药时最好加上浮萍（皮肤病用之效果好）；"}]},{"ID":"20240201103819-7ptjkdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201103819-7ptjkdb","updated":"20240201103834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180.1、解热，发汗，利水的，祛湿；能够消皮肤肿、皮肤肿痒、水肿也可以、风疹、丹毒、眼刺、目翳，凡是热证在表面上看到的都可以加一点浮萍。"}]},{"ID":"20240201103915-5o16514","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201103915-5o16514","updated":"20240201104412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180.2、浮萍发表效果不如桂枝麻黄，所以用药思路取微汗时可用浮萍；（光是单味的浮萍没有办法发汗的，一定要有些药配在里面才有办法去发汗。）"}]},{"ID":"20240201104243-qtkkn9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201104243-qtkkn9t","updated":"20240201104336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180.3、下气，以沐浴生毛发——刘元素；浮萍洗头能生毛发（洗头好了，就别洗身体）；"}]},{"ID":"20240201103656-7oaqakp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201103656-7oaqakp","updated":"20240201104604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、土瓜根，专门治疗女性的闭经；（剂量太大病人会呕吐，恶心呕吐。）"}]},{"ID":"20240201105326-hej1yxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201105326-hej1yxd","updated":"20240201105918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、地榆，主要使用时机是止血、收敛，可外用；如内痔下血；"}]},{"ID":"20240201105816-qoydl25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201105816-qoydl25","updated":"20240201105845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182.1、阿胶跟地榆都能止血，阿胶比较偏重于这个女人的月经。地榆呢比较偏重于肠胃、大肠、肛门这边，还有吐血用地榆。"}]},{"ID":"20240201105347-zqe43sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201105347-zqe43sx","updated":"20240201105558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、下血时看血的颜色，如血是黑色的，说明是远血，可能来自胃或其他内脏，如血是鲜红色的，是近血，则是来自肛门或大肠；"}]},{"ID":"20240201105719-sswqe4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201105719-sswqe4m","updated":"20240201105740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、血无止法：如果你把身体机能调理回来，血自然停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240201105741-4ub5ia3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201105741-4ub5ia3","updated":"20240201110306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、海藻：专门治疗瘿瘤，颈下的核。破散结气，咸味的东西都能够破结软坚。海藻专门软喉咙这边的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240201112436-vemhx8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201112436-vemhx8z","updated":"20240201112444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185.1、海藻——长寿的零食；"}]},{"ID":"20240201112444-34s0vze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201112444-34s0vze","updated":"20240201113110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、防己治中下焦湿热，泄脚气，行十二经，几乎全身性的水肿，防己都能够把他统统泻出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240201113150-yojcjqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201113150-yojcjqq","updated":"20240201113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186.1、可通过防己泻三焦系统进行减肥，因为胖的人三焦经，内脏之间油比较多，用防己可以把油清出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240201113113-1df9rqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201113113-1df9rqb","updated":"20240201114618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、款冬花，药性温和，能引肺气下行，止咳定喘；"}]},{"ID":"20240201114618-vym5upb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201114618-vym5upb","updated":"20240201134246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、发表时，没有麻黄的话，可以用荆芥发表；"}]},{"ID":"20240201134206-paa2mwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201134206-paa2mwi","updated":"20240201135010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、竹叶可以解热祛痰，止渴镇静，治疗消渴，临床上治疗最多的就是消渴；"}]},{"ID":"20240201135010-o70mokp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201135010-o70mokp","updated":"20240201141117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、吴茱萸味辛温，可杀三虫，止痛疗痹开郁，治心腹冷痛，呕吐泻利；"}]},{"ID":"20240201141421-1fw7ac2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201141421-1fw7ac2","updated":"20240201141423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.1、吴茱萸是燥药，非常的燥，所以湿很盛的时候，我们都会用到吴茱萸"}]},{"ID":"20240201142031-igttuld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201142031-igttuld","updated":"20240201142123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.2、吴茱萸常常配合干姜在使用；（干姜入胃，吴茱萸入肝，那这两个碰在一起的话，肝胃之间的寒就能够去掉，也就是中焦的寒都可以去掉）"}]},{"ID":"20240201141117-n1v0ngz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201141117-n1v0ngz","updated":"20240201142553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、孕期呕吐：人参半夏干姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240201143122-5hvxj8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201143122-5hvxj8c","updated":"20240201143213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、栀子是泻火主要的药，主五脏内部邪热，心烦心中懊憹，三焦火旺，清胃皖的血，那治五种黄病，发黄，只要热症，通通可以使用栀子；"}]},{"ID":"20240201143213-mio75ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201143213-mio75ai","updated":"20240201143404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、心脏不断的搏动产生的热，那这个热气是往上升的，肺是相傅之官来制节它，所以肺和心两个关系很好的时候，肺就可以把心脏的热往下导，让这个热进入小肠，那如果肺的津液不够，心的热往上走的时候，心火太盛，这个时候就会懊憹啊产生心烦，这时我们可以用栀子的时候，用肺金来制心火；"}]},{"ID":"20240201143405-o9ri3cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201143405-o9ri3cx","updated":"20240201144108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194、桔子树过了淮河往北就是枳，以南就是桔子。"}]},{"ID":"20240201144127-kl3jhnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201144127-kl3jhnm","updated":"20240201144129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194.1、枳实，它皮厚而中坚，即是早熟还没完全成熟。等到晚采者为枳壳，皮薄而中虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240201144130-e8e3qdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201144130-e8e3qdz","updated":"20240201144457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194.2、心脏疾病患者胸中多有痰，常用枳实，可破气行痰；"}]},{"ID":"20240201144443-l6e73hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201144443-l6e73hy","updated":"20240201161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195、枳实和厚朴两个常常并用，厚朴入大肠，枳实入小肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240201161746-z1rdrge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201161746-z1rdrge","updated":"20240201162755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195.1、厚朴能下实、散满，祛湿健胃；厚朴专门治逆气"}]},{"ID":"20240201161808-iknqp3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201161808-iknqp3y","updated":"20240201163914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196、目赤、眼痒、刺痛。我们那个角膜炎、结膜炎，可用秦皮的汤来洗眼睛，效果良好；"}]},{"ID":"20240201163908-gccydqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201163908-gccydqu","updated":"20240201170827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"197、山茱萸可滋阴助阳养血涩精，久服明目、强力，治脑骨痛、耳鸣，肾虚的人耳鸣；补肾气、兴阳道、坚阴茎"}]},{"ID":"20240201162756-siotuwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201162756-siotuwh","updated":"20240201171450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"198、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"秦椒呢，就是开刀以后伤口长得很大，皮肤有红红的一条一条的鲜红色粉红色的，我们用秦椒。那是内服，有外用的，但不是秦椒也不是秦皮，用僵蚕，我们外面用僵蚕，僵蚕收疤的时候，收得疤皮肤颜色很漂亮。那秦椒秦皮呢我们可以做洗眼的药水用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240201171430-46px1no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201171430-46px1no","updated":"20240201171911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199、猪苓利水道，治渴而小便不利，消渴，久服伤肾；吃太多会大燥，人会亡津液。所以没有湿症的人不要随便去用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240201171825-i7ougbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201171825-i7ougbb","updated":"20240201172745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"200、经期推荐方：龙眼红糖生姜（可自行加味，如蜂蜜）；"}]},{"ID":"20240201172652-jxkabbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201172652-jxkabbm","updated":"20240201173829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"201、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鹿茸：补督脉最强动物性的药；败龟板：补任脉最强动物性的药；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240201173747-spscf7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201173747-spscf7l","updated":"20240201174608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202、牛骨熬汤补骨髓效果良好；"}]},{"ID":"20240201174611-2ozz4q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201174611-2ozz4q9","updated":"20240202084422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203、露蜂房长得像乳房，所以可用于通乳，如加上催乳药，可同步解决奶水不够的问题；奶水不下也可用露蜂房，加咸味药（咸能软坚）通导下来；"}]},{"ID":"20240202084644-ix9ahd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202084644-ix9ahd0","updated":"20240202085105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.1、像女性胸部有硬块，也可用露蜂房；露蜂房较轻，不用太多，几分就够了；"}]},{"ID":"20240202085106-yg690xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202085106-yg690xw","updated":"20240202085114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.2、褥疮：也可用露蜂房；"}]},{"ID":"20240202085511-vgdibx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202085511-vgdibx7","updated":"20240202085534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.3、水煮服能够下乳石；"}]},{"ID":"20240202084716-g3bt91u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202084716-g3bt91u","updated":"20240202090331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"204、鳖甲攻坚力量很强；可活血化瘀、堕胎，能攻破肝气，去症瘕；"}]},{"ID":"20240202090141-7hmcw4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202090141-7hmcw4c","updated":"20240202090904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205、螃蟹可解漆毒（例新房子装修立即搬进去住，油漆中毒），全身高热，皮肤赤红发痒，可将螃蟹蒸熟，放在肚脐上，可将毒气吸走；（一般是淡水蟹，不是海蟹）"}]},{"ID":"20240202090943-gvs8nk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202090943-gvs8nk5","updated":"20240202091126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"螃蟹主治散血结舒肝气，利肢节；螃蟹吃多中毒，包括鱼虾吃了过敏中毒，可吃苏叶（苏叶\\紫苏叶）解；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240201173827-2phnn95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201173827-2phnn95","updated":"20240202092957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206、海螵蛸（乌贼鱼骨），大部分用在男人睾丸有问题或阴茎有问题，女人月经有问题，女人子宫太冷，能够通经，能补肝；"}]},{"ID":"20240202093105-p7tqha6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202093105-p7tqha6","updated":"20240202093305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207、白僵蝉，可美容收疤；打粉敷脸，美容祛斑；"}]},{"ID":"20240202093306-ak6v489","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202093306-ak6v489","updated":"20240202093405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207.1、白僵蝉可以拔疔，疔是有个硬快，很深。这个白僵蚕放在上面它可以拔疔。这个你摸上有个硬块在里面。白僵蚕涂上去疔会往外走，它会吸出来。再深的根白僵蚕都可以把它吸出来。这是外用。外用的时候要打粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240202093429-e4emyov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202093429-e4emyov","updated":"20240202093904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207.2、白僵蝉打粉内服，可祛风化痰，齿痛头痛（头痛效果良好），中风失音；甲状腺肿，淋巴肿瘤都可使用；皮肤中有虫在跑（其实是风症）也可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240202093335-vi6i2f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202093335-vi6i2f6","updated":"20240202094330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"208、头痛方：川穹+白僵蝉+白附子；（重用通治大部分头痛，如无效，可能是脑瘤）"}]},{"ID":"20240202094318-sucumir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202094318-sucumir","updated":"20240202101415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"209、伏翼（蝙蝠大便）：是散血明目的要药；专门治眼睛有内障，有眼翳，青盲，夜盲，都可以使用，主要功能是养血明目；"}]},{"ID":"20240202101416-mrxlpe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202101416-mrxlpe8","updated":"20240202102007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"210、乌梅和白梅，乌梅是采半黄的梅实，用烟熏过，熏黑了以后，再用稻草灰来淋，再蒸过，很酸。白梅又叫做盐梅。"}]},{"ID":"20240202102239-791lz08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202102239-791lz08","updated":"20240202102241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211、乌梅主治：收敛、解热、消肿、驱虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240202102405-iqkjp9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202102405-iqkjp9w","updated":"20240202102416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211.2、硫磺中毒可用乌梅解；"}]},{"ID":"20240202102242-osp9y5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202102242-osp9y5g","updated":"20240202110257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"212、鳖瘕（皮肤生的硬块）：撒一点粉锡或涂抹在硬块上；"}]},{"ID":"20240202110257-xp3rk4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202110257-xp3rk4b","updated":"20240202112641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213、代赭石重镇入血分，也叫血师；能降血止噫止呕；"}]},{"ID":"20240202112641-p45vx09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202112641-p45vx09","updated":"20240204085908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214、胃酸高：旋覆花代赭石汤（常用于热症；停掉咖啡、人工糖制品）；"}]},{"ID":"20240202114438-amcz8uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202114438-amcz8uf","updated":"20240202114457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214、酸不下去，会导致胃癌或胰脏癌（木克土）；"}]},{"ID":"20240202114055-8f9erdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202114055-8f9erdt","updated":"20240202115316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215、多吃酸醋不会有胆结石（醋是乌醋，好的米醋哦，人工醋是不行的），多吃咸的不会有肾结石（海盐，没法清除肾结石。吃青盐，内陆盐本身可以清肾结石）；"}]},{"ID":"20240202114928-97a5pcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202114928-97a5pcy","updated":"20240202115251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216、肾结石：茯苓戎盐汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240202115245-0bcu695","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202115245-0bcu695","updated":"20240202133959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217、豆腐能解附子毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240202134000-si9bx1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202134000-si9bx1v","updated":"20240202134122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"218、炮附子表虚时用，"}]},{"ID":"20240202115321-iwh5wmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202115321-iwh5wmj","updated":"20240202134602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219、命门的火不够了，生附子就是可以点这个火。石硫磺一样可以点这个火。但不一样功能。生附子黑色，专门入肾入骨头。硫磺呢，黄色的，颜色不一样，专门入三焦，上焦、中焦、下焦，入奇恒之腑。"}]},{"ID":"20240202135401-5motss3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202135401-5motss3","updated":"20240202135413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219.1、肉桂可以温命门火；"}]},{"ID":"20240202135503-219yfa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202135503-219yfa0","updated":"20240202135517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219.2、实际上这个命门火的源头叫心脏，当我们人吸一口气进来我们叫天阳，吸进来这个天的阳到了心里面好像氧气一样，突然氧很多火就很旺，这个心火因为我们吸入的阳火旺起来，这个火再到命门，就是我们的命门火，所以真正的命门火的源头是来自我们吸入的天阳；"}]},{"ID":"20240202134609-yinnh58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202134609-yinnh58","updated":"20240202155016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"220、附子本草中，毒性排列，最不毒是天雄，中小毒是附子，大毒是乌头；"}]},{"ID":"20240202155611-yvjknr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202155611-yvjknr1","updated":"20240202155615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"220.1、治癌症的时候我们用生附子，治关节炎的时候我们用乌头，壮元阳壮肾壮阳的时候我们可以用天雄；"}]},{"ID":"20240202135934-mxb6fvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202135934-mxb6fvc","updated":"20240202140443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221、生附子开时，如三钱服药后感觉，剂量到此为止，不要再添加了，如果没有感觉，就加到四钱；"}]},{"ID":"20240202142209-j0nfjz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202142209-j0nfjz2","updated":"20240202142225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221.1、很多的癌症必须使用生附子，急救救逆的时候也常要使用生附子；"}]},{"ID":"20240202140443-0tm8lsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202140443-0tm8lsg","updated":"20240202151759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"222、用生附子时常常病人会吐白津出来，这是由于里寒或肾脏功能衰败导致，属于正常且良好的表现；也可能表现为小便尿多；水肿也能用生附子，排水力量很强；"}]},{"ID":"20240202143421-xadneef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202143421-xadneef","updated":"20240202143801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"223、当归生姜羊肉汤+生附子：滋补除寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240202143801-8k1k97k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202143801-8k1k97k","updated":"20240202154828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"224、乌头分川乌和草乌两种，草乌头剧毒，伤科外用的，川乌头剧毒，特殊制过后能酌情使用；"}]},{"ID":"20240202153606-cw964vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202153606-cw964vz","updated":"20240202153948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师乌头用法："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"这乌头呢一定要先经过水煮，比如说我一般的剂量是这样子，这是我使用的剂量，诸位就按照我的剂量来用，永远不会错，因为我没有错，你们也不会跟着错，那以后你高兴，你就加重，你看病人嘛，增加重量都没关系。我平常是乌头一两，啊，川乌，然后呢，三碗水煮成一碗，煮成一碗以后去渣，也就是说乌头你不要用了，知道我的意思吧，就拿个滤网，把渣给丢了，乌头就没了，剩下一碗乌头汤，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"还没有完啊，你不要拿去给病人喝啊，当场的就隔屁着凉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"，然后呢再去，两碗的蜜，蜂蜜，蜂蜜配合混合下去，混合这个一碗的乌头汤。那你这一碗的乌头汤跟两碗蜜和在一起的时候，蜜是不是就溶化，就比较稀，对不对？好，再煮，再煮成两碗，就拿到手上啦，这是最稳当的，然后这两碗就是我们所谓的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头蜜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"，那蜜是暗黑色，黑黑的。处方的时候，我们用桂枝汤，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头桂枝汤。你用桂枝汤，比如说桂枝三钱、白芍三钱、生姜两片、红枣十枚，炙甘草三钱，然后呢，你就六碗水煮成两碗，吃的时候，拿一个汤匙，我们平常中国人喝汤的汤匙，一平匙乌头蜜倒下去和一和。你拿这个乌头蜜，这样子稀释过以后，然后再拿一次只吃一个汤匙，你去看看它会不会中毒？如果吃下去病人说我这个关节还在痛，下次改两个汤匙，加重一点。一个汤匙一个汤匙加，或者是半个汤匙，你怕，半个汤匙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240202154001-mbwlmhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202154001-mbwlmhl","updated":"20240202154006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.1、这个药可以治疗西医所谓的类风湿性关节炎；"}]},{"ID":"20240202153625-z6b7b2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202153625-z6b7b2o","updated":"20240202154609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226、黄连解尿毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240202154610-xmzqhhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202154610-xmzqhhy","updated":"20240202155306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227、基本原则：阳举没有问题时不要用壮阳的药，可能会负负得正；"}]},{"ID":"20240202155307-y2aefpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202155307-y2aefpb","updated":"20240202155913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"228、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果治疗水肿，我们炮附子生附子下去水退了，退了以后告诉你，盐巴不要吃。海盐不要吃，我们在使用的这些药都是盐性的药，再吃盐巴病会回来的，人是圆形的，太过病又会回头；所以治疗肾脏病的时候忌盐巴；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240202155755-vo962h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202155755-vo962h6","updated":"20240202160114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229、半夏可祛痰止咳开喉；"}]},{"ID":"20240202160629-obxb5qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202160629-obxb5qs","updated":"20240202161012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏能去至高至水，如肺里有水，脑中积水；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240202161158-t7q9ofj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202161158-t7q9ofj","updated":"20240202161223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.2、口渴一般不用半夏，半夏抵水力道强，越用越渴；"}]},{"ID":"20240202161559-7kcvp80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202161559-7kcvp80","updated":"20240202161604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.3、喉咙痛，恶心，呕吐，咳嗽第一个想到就是半夏"}]},{"ID":"20240202162013-w6w9w7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202162013-w6w9w7e","updated":"20240202162033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.4、半夏反乌头，忌饴糖海藻羊血；"}]},{"ID":"20240202160115-40dg4xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202160115-40dg4xq","updated":"20240202160317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230、祛痰急救方——三生饮：生半夏3钱、生（天）南星3钱，生附子3钱，三碗煮一碗水；"}]},{"ID":"20240202160318-3ufdz5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202160318-3ufdz5l","updated":"20240202160921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231、男怕脚肿，女怕戴帽（头肿）；"}]},{"ID":"20240202160922-q9p7z5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202160922-q9p7z5c","updated":"20240202161833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"232、口渴但不想喝水：标准的体内有淤血；"}]},{"ID":"20240202161833-wxxvozs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202161833-wxxvozs","updated":"20240202162344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233、天南星，有大毒，去胸腔肺里的痰力量强（攻痰峻药）；"}]},{"ID":"20240202163135-f5b0fcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202163135-f5b0fcx","updated":"20240202163144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.1、误服天南星的时候嘴唇会麻舌头会麻，一般你吃到药物舌头开始麻就代表里面有毒哦，得防风则不麻，防风可以解南星的毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240202162304-tshslx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202162304-tshslx0","updated":"20240202163056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"234、半夏去痰，天南星也去痰，两个差异在哪里？天南星治痰功同半夏，但半夏比较去水，痰之前是水，水没有去掉才成痰，停太久变成痰，所以半夏去水，天南星去痰；"}]},{"ID":"20240202153637-2tgi76e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202153637-2tgi76e","updated":"20240202163755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"235、黄帝内经灵枢经是一门解剖学；"}]},{"ID":"20240202163755-pxrggo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202163755-pxrggo6","updated":"20240202163852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"236、经方在处理吃拉肚子的食物方剂：大黄甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240202163852-pygaxo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202163852-pygaxo7","updated":"20240202164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"237、大黄是泻实的药，它并不去热；"}]},{"ID":"20240202165228-7aab9ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202165228-7aab9ir","updated":"20240202165249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"237.1、大黄需要其攻的药性时，尽量生用；"}]},{"ID":"20240202164716-3gb3qs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202164716-3gb3qs7","updated":"20240202164747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"238、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"基本原则：危急的重症，想办法让他肠胃通畅，从喉咙到肛、直肠出去一路顺畅！能够消化食物，饿能够消化食物。基本上能够掌握这个样子的话，他就不会死，再重也不会死；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240202164739-2bc7y9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202164739-2bc7y9m","updated":"20240202164857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"239、大黄跟黄连药性刚好相关，大黄是走、迅捷，不会停留；黄连是守而不走。"}]},{"ID":"20240202164722-urzuo7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202164722-urzuo7h","updated":"20240202165443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240、葶苈子，味辛寒无毒，治肿块，利水道，常用于治疗肺癌；"}]},{"ID":"20240202165521-ruti26k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202165521-ruti26k","updated":"20240202165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240.1、葶苈子，在河南陕西河北这一带，有甜苦两种，现在都是以甜的入药了；"}]},{"ID":"20240202165717-y91b8ko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202165717-y91b8ko","updated":"20240202165750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240.2、如早起水停于面，面目浮肿，可用配伍葶苈子对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240202165855-y1qkyf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202165855-y1qkyf9","updated":"20240202170050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240.3、葶苈子多油，能够滑利。味辛辣，葶苈子隐含在—介于巴豆与大黄二者之间的药，也是猛药。一般处方葶苈子三钱四钱都会用到；葶苈子下水力道强，会伤胃气，所以可以用大（红）枣中和护胃；"}]},{"ID":"20240202165529-u1ub0q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202165529-u1ub0q9","updated":"20240204084054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"241、痰颜色：焦黄的，配伍生半夏、天南星能处理；白色有白沫有泡泡的（有一定可能是肺癌），桔梗；"}]},{"ID":"20240204084119-cam3llj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204084119-cam3llj","updated":"20240204084304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"242、桔梗除了排脓以外还排血，常常用桔梗甘草汤病人用药后会咳血出来，这些血是咳嗽久了支气管破裂形成的淤血；"}]},{"ID":"20240204084304-b858yqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204084304-b858yqs","updated":"20240204084948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"243、草蒿（青蒿），是治疗皮肤病、疥疮的主力药，还有肝胆方面的，肝胆方面的火。"}]},{"ID":"20240204084949-yajhgsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204084949-yajhgsb","updated":"20240204092804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"244、蜀漆（常山），主治疟疾；"}]},{"ID":"20240204092732-peb5jjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204092732-peb5jjz","updated":"20240204093347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"245、甘遂+牵牛各三钱，治疗腹水肿（这个有个规矩，这两味药使用的时候一定要看到脚肿，脚肿大，肿得非常大，好像那个整个膨起来像大气球一样，才可以使用，才是使用的时机，代表是实水。如果是脚肿，你压下去又弹起来这不是实水，不能用；你按下去，凹下去，弹不起来，对症可用）"}]},{"ID":"20240204093435-o4hyma7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204093435-o4hyma7","updated":"20240204093437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"245.1、甘遂和牵牛比起来，牵牛速度很快，甘遂还很慢，这两个药碰在一起的时候，它不会不缓不急就停在水道上面，可以把水"}]},{"ID":"20240204093438-3krirfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204093438-3krirfc","updated":"20240204101816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★245.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人吃完以后上吐下泄，小便也出来，大便也排水，嘴巴也吐水，吐出很多痰；（肿消掉以后，忌盐，一点都不能吃，不然肿又会回来了，因为盐巴是负担）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204093737-hwnquzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204093737-hwnquzs","updated":"20240204094208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"245.3、如果说使用了这个药，没有去忌盐，再回头，水再回来的时候，你再用甘遂，用牵牛，排不出来了。只有一次机会。"}]},{"ID":"20240204093457-6rmqgd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204093457-6rmqgd1","updated":"20240204094527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246、甘遂+芫花+大戟除胸中积水；"}]},{"ID":"20240204094527-ksutvys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204094527-ksutvys","updated":"20240204115059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂处方的时候我们用钱做单位，三钱一剂。如果是用粉的时候，一包一次是一钱，一钱里面有三分之一是甘遂粉，另外三分之一芫花，三分之一大戟，各占三分之一，这个是粉剂，配合红枣来吞。（把那个粉放在嘴巴里用红枣吞下去）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204095122-q10lyuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204095122-q10lyuq","updated":"20240204101257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246.2、甘遂能泄12种（十二经？）水及去痰水；恶远志反甘草；甘遂是生用，不要炮制，炮制没力量；"}]},{"ID":"20240204095903-cw22h8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204095903-cw22h8q","updated":"20240204095929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"247、草决明味苦，微寒，正肝明目，治疗赤障，青盲，眼翳膜；"}]},{"ID":"20240204095925-rgdej2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204095925-rgdej2i","updated":"20240204100809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"248、白及（白芨）为止肺血、疗伤的要药，逐淤生新，补肺损，止吐血；可用于肺部内伤，如拳击、撞伤等；"}]},{"ID":"20240204100317-gg9nbsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204100317-gg9nbsn","updated":"20240204101250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"249、十二条经络，积水，全身的积水，腹满，都可以使用大戟。"}]},{"ID":"20240204101305-mar2con","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204101305-mar2con","updated":"20240204102118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"250、大戟中毒，可用菖蒲解；"}]},{"ID":"20240204102102-5nog8kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204102102-5nog8kq","updated":"20240204103228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"251、贯中味苦，微寒，有毒，可治蛔虫；能解毒，治腹中邪热；"}]},{"ID":"20240204103148-h4z90sz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204103148-h4z90sz","updated":"20240204104505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"252、商陆有两种，一种是赤根的，一种是白根的，白色的入药，赤色的可以外用，赤色的很毒，不要吃，赤色可以拿来打粉跟麝香敷肚脐加热利水，效果比白色好；"}]},{"ID":"20240204104507-0yszp7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204104507-0yszp7t","updated":"20240204104519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"252.1、商陆一般用根；"}]},{"ID":"20240204104256-l9mkmgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204104256-l9mkmgv","updated":"20240204105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"253、白头翁，张仲景治疗热下痢主要药；"}]},{"ID":"20240204105704-cgd51ey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204105704-cgd51ey","updated":"20240204111259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"254、连翘，散结清火，解毒，消肿排脓；"}]},{"ID":"20240204111305-x93d0ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204111305-x93d0ck","updated":"20240204111307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"254.1、四川的品质最好；"}]},{"ID":"20240204111408-ce2w68u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204111408-ce2w68u","updated":"20240204111413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"254.2、牙痛、鼻塞，眼睛的赤肿赤痛，青春痘都可以使用连翘；"}]},{"ID":"20240204111413-355plnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204111413-355plnh","updated":"20240204111717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"255、蚤休打粉，可解蛇毒（响尾蛇、百步蛇...）；"}]},{"ID":"20240204111718-5sppkbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204111718-5sppkbi","updated":"20240204112212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256、夏枯草用在治疗喉咙的病，扁桃腺发炎，喉咙的病，还有甲状腺肿块；"}]},{"ID":"20240204112215-erl6q6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204112215-erl6q6t","updated":"20240204112709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.1、夏枯草煮鸡蛋，吃鸡蛋喝汤（喉咙不会发炎，免疫系统就会很强）；发病的时候这么吃没有用，配药的时候放夏枯草则有用；"}]},{"ID":"20240204112744-4uvq5oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204112744-4uvq5oe","updated":"20240204112748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.2、夏枯草是冬至以后开始出生，到夏至就枯萎掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240204112851-cc035l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204112851-cc035l6","updated":"20240204112913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.3、夏枯草可以退肝胆经的火，因此呢肝病的人，胆有病的人、发炎的人统统可以使用夏枯草。（需对症）"}]},{"ID":"20240204112236-m6jrhd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204112236-m6jrhd0","updated":"20240204112508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"257、人发烧到一定程度温度不上去，是因为扁桃腺在作用，如果被西医割除了扁桃腺，发烧温度会一直飙升至高烧昏迷；"}]},{"ID":"20240204112611-efvn1js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204112611-efvn1js","updated":"20240204113724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"258、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻上焦积水（芫花）。脏腑之间积水（大戟），把上中下焦水排出体外（甘遂）——十枣汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204113519-b85xd6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204113519-b85xd6z","updated":"20240204113938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"259、十枣汤不加红枣副作用：如果没有加红枣，里面没有胃液了嘛，整个黏的，胃壁会黏在一起，肠壁会黏在一起，黏在一起的感觉呢？病人吃不饱！吃东西吃下去，还是饿还是不饱。为什么？因为它黏在一起，完全没有津液了，这时就要红枣。"}]},{"ID":"20240204113949-l2zp7ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204113949-l2zp7ys","updated":"20240204115934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"260、当你不通的时候，什么样都没办法的时候，你就要想到巴豆，巴豆是唯一最后一线的药，最后一线攻坚的药！"}]},{"ID":"20240204115934-0tekxoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204115934-0tekxoy","updated":"20240204115953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"260.1、巴豆中毒下痢喝冷水就能解；"}]},{"ID":"20240204115953-223yy1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204115953-223yy1t","updated":"20240204135228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"261、蜀椒毒性分辨，蜀椒壳崩开有裂口的无毒，闭口的有毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240204135231-2gq1lkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204135231-2gq1lkv","updated":"20240204142002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"262、皂荚主治通窍搜风、拔毒杀虫，能清陈年老痰；"}]},{"ID":"20240204142004-jmzl5gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204142004-jmzl5gr","updated":"20240204163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"263、金铃子+元胡索+乳香+没药：中药的止痛配伍；"}]},{"ID":"20240204143735-llwueez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204143735-llwueez","updated":"20240204145935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"264、地龙（白颈蚯蚓）：利于排水，可用在攻坚（脑积水、脑部肿瘤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240204150058-a0bb4s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204150058-a0bb4s3","updated":"20240204150108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"265、那中药有饭前还是饭后服，如果我们要病人，这个药能够攻到脑部去，大部分都是饭后吃，要攻到往下焦攻到小肠大肠攻到膝盖攻到脚部的时候，都是饭前吃，大部分都是这样子。那发表的药也是在饭前吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240204150115-9ol26ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204150115-9ol26ao","updated":"20240204150249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"266、淋巴癌，淋巴肿块，肝癌肿块，都会使用到蜈蚣，但动物性的药它本身攻坚的力量很强，但同时会伤血，一定会伤到，所以说你要加一些补血的药，混合在一起，攻补、补泻兼顾。"}]},{"ID":"20240204150445-tnrhgzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204150445-tnrhgzf","updated":"20240204150457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"267、挑水蛭的时候，体型越细小的力量越大；"}]},{"ID":"20240204150458-bl1kxmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204150458-bl1kxmt","updated":"20240204150941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268、误吞水蛭急救法：用田中泥一两，雄黄二钱为丸，分四服，开水下，即随大便而出；桂圆肉包烟油吞之，即下；此物畏石灰食盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240204151906-9tfbsug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204151906-9tfbsug","updated":"20240204151922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269、任何的淤血需要活血化瘀的时候都可以用到桃仁；"}]},{"ID":"20240204152031-3fdxnn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204152031-3fdxnn0","updated":"20240204152715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269.1、桃仁：桃子里面的核，核打破里面的仁；"}]},{"ID":"20240204152716-9naty5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204152716-9naty5u","updated":"20240204152942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269.2、桃仁吃多会上火，呈现的症状是脸上长痘；"}]},{"ID":"20240204152727-plxlp6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204152727-plxlp6l","updated":"20240204153445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270、杏仁：可治疗咳逆上气，治喘咳，宣肺祛痰（黄浊的痰）；"}]},{"ID":"20240204153629-3f5or1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204153629-3f5or1c","updated":"20240204153644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270.1、杏仁入汤药时，打碎药性较容易出来；"}]},{"ID":"20240204153743-qf5kyhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204153743-qf5kyhi","updated":"20240204153757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270.2、跟桃仁一样，杏仁吃多了容易长痘；"}]},{"ID":"20240204153644-fd1ror6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204153644-fd1ror6","updated":"20240204154744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"271、青盐炮附粉：作刷牙粉使用，牙齿坚固；"}]},{"ID":"20240204154744-q3w5j2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204154744-q3w5j2w","updated":"20240204155758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"272、红花：藏红花没有味道，川红花会有股臭味，相比藏红花，川红花更便宜些，找不到藏红花的话，用川红花替代，剂量重点即可；"}]},{"ID":"20240204155258-p4m268i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204155258-p4m268i","updated":"20240204155608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"273、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治风先治血，血行风自灭；肝就是风脏，所以治肝先治血，血行肝病自然就会好；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204151924-2rspdnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204151924-2rspdnw","updated":"20240204160638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"274、长藓：用醋（米醋最好）煮艾叶，外涂；"}]},{"ID":"20240204160558-wqjd74d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204160558-wqjd74d","updated":"20240204161151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275、饴糖（麦芽糖）去中药行品质较好；"}]},{"ID":"20240204161300-bohpgpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204161300-bohpgpb","updated":"20240204161350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275.1、不一定要建中汤，你平常的汤药里面病人气很虚的时候你都可以加些饴糖（麦芽糖）进去；"}]},{"ID":"20240204161333-g00c3wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204161333-g00c3wf","updated":"20240204161345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275.2、饴糖（麦芽糖）吃多了会损齿；"}]},{"ID":"20240204161304-j4w0vnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204161304-j4w0vnf","updated":"20240204161429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276、蔗糖与饴糖不同，蔗糖吃多健齿，饴糖吃多损齿；"}]},{"ID":"20240204161430-274w3lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204161430-274w3lf","updated":"20240204161835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"277、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生发剂：当归+侧柏叶，煮后内服，药渣可再煮一遍洗头；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204161827-876y1zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204161827-876y1zf","updated":"20240204162255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"278、栀子豆豉汤：常用于病人大病初愈后的失眠；"}]},{"ID":"20240204162255-6o8sjf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204162255-6o8sjf2","updated":"20240204163015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"279、没药：散血消肿定痛生肌；常与乳香搭配，常用于伤科跌打损伤；"}]},{"ID":"20240204163015-2sj5p8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204163015-2sj5p8w","updated":"20240204163436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"280、乳香：活血伸筋的要药，抽经脚痉挛绷的很紧，我们会用到乳香；"}]},{"ID":"20240204163500-pbil2er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204163500-pbil2er","updated":"20240204163502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"280.1、要房间香一点你烧点乳香房间里面变得很香，这个它主要是通行周身经络，能够去风散瘀，活血定痛，托疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240204163503-18atsho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204163503-18atsho","updated":"20240204164118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"281、梗米能补脾清肺，现在大多用的是糯米，越陈越好；"}]},{"ID":"20240204164046-fscoi9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204164046-fscoi9p","updated":"20240204164500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"282、早餐食用红番薯煮稀饭：滋补脾胃，长寿饮食；"}]},{"ID":"20240204164703-1cd905z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204164703-1cd905z","updated":"20240204164715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"283、李根白皮：治疗奔豚气逆；"}]},{"ID":"20240204164716-doa3lex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204164716-doa3lex","updated":"20240204164734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"283、奔豚气逆举例：觉得身上心跳得很快，好像甚而身上热水在滚着，还有病人会跟你陈述说：奇怪好象有个人上面有个腾，热的茶壶，然后把水倒着从我头上灌下来，哇那热水一直灌下来，摸摸看又没有啊冰冰的，他就是感到很热，还在身上跑来跑去，这都属于奔豚气逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240204164738-aq3hfzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204164738-aq3hfzi","updated":"20240204164932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"284、三七：活血化瘀，散一切恶血；（三七的止痛，大部分都是伤科的止痛。骨折、筋拉伤、脱臼、刀伤、砍伤、车祸的外伤、现在还有枪伤，马脚的踢伤，什么伤都可以，都可以用三七）"}]},{"ID":"20240204165001-vx1yjrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204165001-vx1yjrk","updated":"20240204165008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"284.1、乳房的痛、臭、化脓都可以使用三七；"}]},{"ID":"20240204165008-ic9pcca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204165008-ic9pcca","updated":"20240221190646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"285、黄连阿胶汤加鸡蛋黄的药理（汤药放温，鸡蛋黄生用）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡蛋黄其实是一个导引的药，所以我们所谓君臣佐使，这个所谓的，你这个补血的药，要补到心脏里面去，那心中有一滴血，心脏的正中心有一滴血，这一滴血是永远是新鲜的，那新的血去取代旧的血，新的血经过心脏的时候把旧的血踢出来，速度是这样子，一直是新的血去换旧的血，所以是心中一滴血永远是新鲜的，这是正常。所以要学好医学，你要知道什么叫正常，那有一天呢，突然被惊吓到，或者是一些事情影响到扰心烦心，这滴血瞬间消失掉了，消失掉的话心脏这个血，还是有血通过心脏啊，但是是这样子过去的，那一滴血不见了。那我们大家都知道阿胶能够补血的啊，前面那个阿井的那个水啊，潜在地下的水啊，要煮出来那个驴皮，熬出来驴皮啊，那个补血，那你身上很多地方都补啊，要补的话你怎么知道光阿胶补下去的话，补到肝脏、补到肺脏、补到血管里面去，那有补到心脏那么凑巧，所以我们要有一个药，导引阿胶，来告诉阿胶说，你要在心脏中间制造一滴血出来。基于这个道理，中医是意，中药是以意来得到的，那诸位可以在食物里面去找，那一个食物是永远浮在空中的，悬浮在中间的，就是鸡蛋黄，鸡蛋黄悬浮在中间，就好像血填在心脏的正中间是一样的，所以黄连阿胶汤它会使用鸡蛋黄做导药，最主要是要阿胶能够产生心脏里面的血，才能够安眠的功能在这里，那那个病人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204165257-lgqwyo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204165257-lgqwyo4","updated":"20240204165540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆固醇高代表者没有癌症，如西医检测胆固醇很低或等于零，说明癌症，把胆固醇消耗掉了；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204165537-yg6b26f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204165537-yg6b26f","updated":"20240204170131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"287、郁金：能活血能散郁；"}]},{"ID":"20240204170131-05vhuvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204170131-05vhuvu","updated":"20240204170158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"287.1、郁金吃了人心情会开心点；（合欢皮、远志也可配伍）"}]},{"ID":"20240204170841-xno3rjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204170841-xno3rjr","updated":"20240204170942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"288、薤白是很主要的一个治疗胸口刺痛的一个药物；专门治诸疮中风寒水气肿痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240204170847-w87nbf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204170847-w87nbf2","updated":"20240204171438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"289、神曲是帮助消化、消食化痰的药，健脾开胃；主化水谷、宿食，症结，积滞，健脾，暖胃；"}]},{"ID":"20240204171343-e57onav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204171343-e57onav","updated":"20240204171745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"290、甘麦大枣汤：专门用在女人哦，那个如见神灵，常常看到妖魔鬼怪，床旁边站个人，晚上深更半夜，床旁边站个人，如见神明状，还有妇人流泪，那边开party，,生日，大家心情很好啊，几代同堂，大家都很开心，在那边吃东西聊天，她也很开心，一边开心，一边在流眼泪。那为什么开心，眼泪还一直不断在流？这时候要用小麦，因为她子宫，阴道里面整个是干的，津液下不去，从眼睛回逆出来。可用甘麦大枣汤对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240204171848-cows0a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204171848-cows0a2","updated":"20240204172006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"291、能够把破损的胃修补好，就一个灶心土（伏龙肝）；（黄土汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240204172100-hb4k17m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204172100-hb4k17m","updated":"20240221190726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"292、天疱疮：有一种病叫天疱疮，就是小朋友全身皮肤溃烂掉，溃烂到什么程度，如果他的手指头一碰墙壁，碰到一样东西，过5分钟以之后，碰到的东西就会烂掉，化脓，你一抱她，你的手纹的那个地方就会化脓，接触到的地方就糜烂掉，会化脓，这种我们叫天疱疮；生下来就有这个问题，可能是前因带下来的哦，爸爸妈妈带下来的。治疗他的方法，当然我们处方的药很多，但是效果没有一种来的好，就是泥土。那怎么治？就找个地方土比较干净的，我跟你讲哦，不要到处都是狗大便。还有人的大便到处都有，你要小心点，到山里面去找片黄土，土质很好挖个洞，把小孩子埋在里面，头露在外面，你不要把整个埋掉，commonsense。头露在外面给他呼吸，爸妈在旁边陪他，就用土把他全身盖住，他就是碰到那个土，土用来生金用来长皮肤，皮肤会长的非常好，愈后会非常好，很奇怪，就用那个土，那要找干净的土，所以挖前，最好鼻子先闻一下。看看有什么怪味，没有怪味再埋，这样就没有问题，不会发炎，很奇怪，真的不会发炎，土生金，肺，皮肤毛孔是金，所以我们中医用的土可能很多，过去我们看一些报道上面还有一些人在吃土，有没有？拿土来吃啊，实际上土是可以吃的，土本来就是脾胃嘛，但不是每种土都可以吃，在经方里面我们治疗胃出血、胃癌，一定会使用到这个灶心土。"}]}]}